(7516716, 1200423, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is really quite surreal... I can''t even be sure those are real fish. I assume you shot in an aquarium, or some other tank, if they are? Or has someone hung dozens and dozens of plastic fish up? I *think* I can see a few plastic "hangers" in there, as if you cloned ''em all out but missed a few? Whatever.. I like it. You''ll get hammered ''cuz it isn''t people but I have an 8 for you :-) Feel free to let me know if my guess was right; I''m done voting...</td>', 'This is really quite surreal... I can''t even be sure those are real fish. I assume you shot in an aquarium, or some other tank, if they are? Or has someone hung dozens and dozens of plastic fish up? I *think* I can see a few plastic "hangers" in there, as if you cloned ''em all out but missed a few? Whatever.. I like it. You''ll get hammered ''cuz it isn''t people but I have an 8 for you :-) Feel free to let me know if my guess was right; I''m done voting...', '2017-06-02 20:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
