(7518010, 1200423, 67258, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> This is really quite surreal... I can''t even be sure those are real fish. I assume you shot in an aquarium, or some other tank, if they are? Or has someone hung dozens and dozens of plastic fish up? I *think* I can see a few plastic "hangers" in there, as if you cloned ''em all out but missed a few?  </i></td></tr></table>  I had thought they were dead fish on ice from a fish market, with a heavy dose of neat image, but now think I may have been wrong.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: This is really quite surreal... I can''t even be sure those are real fish. I assume you shot in an aquarium, or some other tank, if they are? Or has someone hung dozens and dozens of plastic fish up? I *think* I can see a few plastic "hangers" in there, as if you cloned ''em all out but missed a few?    I had thought they were dead fish on ice from a fish market, with a heavy dose of neat image, but now think I may have been wrong.', '2017-06-09 05:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
